  "safety": "General week-by-week ranges for learning — every pregnancy is different, and these are not a measurement of any individual baby. Sizes and weights are typical averages. This does not replace antenatal care, ultrasound dating, or your midwife/doctor. If you have pain, bleeding, reduced movements or any concern, seek care. Pending clinician sign-off.",
  "trimesters": {
    "first": "weeks 1–12",
    "second": "weeks 13–27",
    "third": "weeks 28–40"
  },
